{"repositoryId":1160899855,"availability":"available","full":"Looted/kibi","name":"kibi","description":"Kibi is a requirement-conformance layer for AI coding agents that keeps product intent connected to code and tests, and catches when implementations drift from it.","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":10,"forks":2,"created":"2026-02-18T14:00:48Z","updated":"2026-10-19T18:01:54Z","license":"AGPL-3.0","branch":"develop","homepage":"https://looted.github.io/kibi/","topics":["agentic-ai","bdd","codex-plugin","cursor-plugin","development-tools","guardrails","knowledge-base","knowledge-management","mcp","mcp-server","opencode","opencode-plugin","requirement-traceability","requirements-engineering","requirements-engineering-tool","spec-driven","spec-driven-development","traceability"],"demo":"https://looted.github.io/kibi/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T18:05:31.505Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-19T18:05:31.505Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-19T18:05:31.505Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-19T18:05:31.505Z","stars":10,"forks":2}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["[](#beta-status) []( []( []( [](LICENSE.md) [](","Prompt the intent. Kibi makes the agent remember it—and prove the implementation.","Simplified from what Kibi reports in each case."],"features":["Humans maintain intent, not artifacts — The prompt is the primary authoring interface. Agents own the routine work of creating and evolving requirements, scenarios, tests, facts, and symbol links; humans resolve genuine…","Memory is enforceable — Symbols need requirement ownership, requirements need complete semantics and scenarios, scenarios need tests, and proof-bearing tests need fresh execution evidence.","Prolog guards against drift — Typed properties, predicates, and safe rules let deterministic checks expose contradictions, unsupported invention, and incomplete semantics before they become accepted project knowledge.","E2E beha